WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
WE WENT TO THE

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.500
STORE ON MONDAY, AND I THINK
I SAW JOHN. I'M SURE.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.000
>> "REALLY?"

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.000
<i>WELL, I'LL TELL YOU</i>

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
AFTER LUNCH. I'VE GOT TO GO NOW

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.000
OR NEVER…

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.000
(WE RAN.)

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.000
MAYBE I-I SHOULD. I'D SAY SO.
